#5301
A Corn Field~
   Rows and rows of neatly placed corn stalks rise up before you, most several
feet tall. The soil is a dark brown color and looks rich with nutrients for
this bountiful crop. You soon find that the field is surrounded by a waist
high fence and decide perhaps you should return to the road rather than climb
over it.
~
