#5303
A Field of Wheat~
   The wind blows softly which causes ripples in the field before you. It
looks as if a section has recently been farmed, perhaps to stagger the
production of wheat over a year. There is a wooden fence surrounding the
field and you have no option but to return to the road.
   Mountain peaks rise sharply to the south and you find it remarkable that
a farm such as this can grow in this unforgiving climate.
~
