#5307
A Vegetable Garden~
   There is a large variety of vegetables growing here, everything to keep
the citizens of the nearby city fed. You have to be careful as you walk
through them not to crush any of the precious plants unless you want to face
the wrath of the farmer.
   The vegetable plot has been carefully laid out and a wooden fence
surrounds it, preventing travel in any direction other than the one you
came from. Even if you could progress further south, you trip would be
short - mountain peaks rise steeply a mere few feet beyond the fence and
you have no desire to risk your life today.
~
