#5313
The Mist Keep Post Office~
   The Mist Keep post office is a tidy shop with a hard stone floor and pine
walls. Various city dwellers move in and out of the post office without paying
you much heed, intent as they are in sending or receiving their mail. You
notice that the only people actually using the postal system are either
merchants, members of the church, or foreigners. The workers and commoners in
the city simply haven't the money or need for the post office.
~
