#5361
The Street of Mists~
   You stand at the base of the fabled Mist Keep, small cobblestone steps
leading up to the entrance to the south. From here, it resembles a monastery
which would also explain the brown-robed figures who sit and talk nearby.
The city's tavern can be reached to the east where you might find a
comfortable bed and meal while a small office lies to the north.
