The Street of Humility~
   The street continues to the west and east between the outer and inner
city walls. Taking a moment to survey your surroundings, you marvel at the
construction of this place - the walls are perfectly straight and there
doesn't appear to be a single blemish. It must have taken some time to
achieve this state of perfection.
   A small library has been carved out of the wall to the south.
