#5471
At the Temple Altar~
   A series of steps lead up to a rather impressive altar carved from what
looks like basalt. It must have been brought from the mountains and transported
all the way here which is no easy feat. In the corner of the temple, there
is a staircase which descends into the darkness below.
~
