D0
~
~
0 0 5338
D5
~
~
0 0 5339
S
#5472
The Dump~
   The dump is unnaturally hot and relatively free from garbage, both due
to a thermal vent in the ground that spews forth super-heated steam. It's best
not to remain here for too long or you may not live to tell about it.
~
53 c 0
D0
~
~
0 0 5379
S
#5473
The City Donation Room~
   You have to wade through all sorts of items scattered haphazardly over
the room, looking for that one good piece that you need. Travellers and
citizens alike come here to donate items they no longer need so you are
welcome to take whatever you need on your travels.
~
53 cde 0
D0
~
~
0 0 5324
S
#5474
The Olde Magick Shoppe~
   This place looks as old as time itself and the only thing holding it
together is magick! It's extremely dark and the walls are covered with all
forms of scrolls and other magickal pieces. There is a sign on the back
wall.
~
53 acde 0
D1
~
~
0 0 5318
E
sign~
0~
You can BUY, SELL, VALUE or LIST here.
~
S
#5475
The Keep Stables~
   The smell of fresh dung greets your nose as you step into this well-kept
stable.  You can see many fine breeds of horses stored in the extensive
boarding area in front of you, but this front room looks more like a country
store than a stable, complete with a smiling hick ready to take your money.
There is a small sign nailed to a post here.
~
53 cd 0
D2
~
~
0 0 6944
E
sign~
0~
LIST: See what is available and get a price.
BUY: Buy a mount.
STABLE: Set your mount up in our boarding area.
COLLECT: Collect your mount from our boarding area.
~
S
#5476
Merchant Caravan Load Room~
   The merchant, his slaves and his horses will load in this room and all will
be set to follow the merchant before being teleported to the Mist Keep
entrance arch. This prevents players from seeing "X follows Y".
~
53 cdgkt 0
S
